            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 5.2 – Rights to Representation",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                545,
                584,
                574
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    545.0
                ],
                [
                    584.0,
                    545.0
                ],
                [
                    584.0,
                    574.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    574.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Employees have a basic right to representation in matters regarding conditions of employment, working conditions, and matters that could have an adverse impact or effect on their employment, such as disciplinary actions. The Union is the sole exclusive representative of bargaining unit Employees concerning workplace matters.",
            "block_bbox": [
                132,
                601,
                1080,
                716
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    132.0,
                    601.0
                ],
                [
                    1080.0,
                    601.0
                ],
                [
                    1080.0,
                    716.0
                ],
                [
                    132.0,
                    716.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. An Employee who requests Union representation in regards to a workplace matter may do so either verbally or in writing. An Employee also may request that all communication be made with or furnished to their representative.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                740,
                1053,
                825
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    740.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    740.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    825.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    825.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Assignment of Employee representatives is an internal Union matter. Neither the Agency nor the Employee may demand that a particular Union representative respond to a request for representation.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                851,
                1063,
                936
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    851.0
                ],
                [
                    1063.0,
                    851.0
                ],
                [
                    1063.0,
                    936.0
                ],
                [
                    130.0,
                    936.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Upon receiving a representation request from either an Employee or the Agency the Union will assign a qualified representative.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                962,
                1071,
                1019
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    962.0
                ],
                [
                    1071.0,
                    962.0
                ],
